		</div>
		<div class="content-description full-width home">
			<p>I'm a passionate Visual Designer, born in Lima, Peru and trained at LABASAD Barcelona School of Arts & Design and Elisava School of Design & Engineering.</p>

			<p><br>My career has led me to work in <strong><i>UX/UI</i></strong> and <strong><i>web design studios</i></strong>, where I've had the opportunity to develop my skills as a digital artist and art director.</p>

			<p><br>I firmly believe that the success of a project lies in <strong><i>collaboration</i></strong> and <strong><i>the creation of impactful visual experiences.</i></strong></p>
				
			<p><br>I'm excited about the idea of working with you to <strong><i>bring your ideas to life</i></strong> and together build a project that exceeds your expectations</p>
		</div>
